# Example requests for the Prescriptions API.
# Usage: install the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client),
# start the app (./mvnw spring-boot:run), then click "Send Request" above any request.
# Medications 1-5 are seeded by db/init.sql (1 = Aspirin, 2 = Metformin, ...).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### List medications (to see which ids exist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medications

### Create a prescription -> 201 + Location header; label is trimmed
# @name createPrescription
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicationId": 1,
  "timeOfDay": "08:00",
  "label": "  with breakfast  "
}

### Get the prescription just created (uses the id from the response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions/{{createPrescription.response.body.id}}

### Create another one, earlier in the day, without a label -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicationId": 2,
  "timeOfDay": "07:30"
}

### List all prescriptions -> 200, sorted by timeOfDay
GET {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions


### ---------- Invalid input ----------

### Duplicate (same medication + time as above) -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicationId": 1,
  "timeOfDay": "08:00"
}

### Unknown medication -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicationId": 999,
  "timeOfDay": "09:00"
}

### Missing required fields -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Invalid time (hour out of range) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicationId": 1,
  "timeOfDay": "25:00"
}

### Invalid time format (seconds not allowed, strict HH:mm) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicationId": 1,
  "timeOfDay": "08:00:30"
}

### Label longer than 100 characters -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicationId": 1,
  "timeOfDay": "10:00",
  "label": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

### Prescription that does not exist -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions/999

### Non-numeric id -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/prescriptions/abc
